# --- Generated build output ---------------------------------------------
# Root-level bundler output for the former EverPlate web shell. Every file is
# generated or vendored: app.js/vendor.js bundles, Capacitor's native-bridge.js,
# vendored Lora / Source Sans 3 woff2 and pdf.worker.min.mjs, plus the raster
# brand library emitted by build_assets.py. Anchored with a leading slash so it
# can never match a nested dist/ inside apps/ or packages/.
/dist/

# --- Obsolete EverPlate native artifacts --------------------------------
# The historical Capacitor shell: see docs/adr/0001-native-mobile-client.md.
# Rejected direction, obsolete brand name, and entirely generated — installed
# node_modules plus Capacitor-scaffolded ios/ and android/ platform projects
# (including their copied web assets, Xcode user state and build/ output).
# Scoped to this one path so a future legitimate native/ tree stays trackable.
/native/everplate/

# --- Python virtual environments -----------------------------------------
# The brand-asset pipeline's interpreter (~87 MB). Scoped rather than a blanket
# rule so tools/everplate-assets/scripts/, prompts/ and review/ — the inputs
# PROVENANCE.md records as the authoritative sources — remain trackable if
# they are ever restored.
/tools/everplate-assets/.venv/

# --- Scratch output from the brand-asset pipeline -------------------------
# Intermediate candidate renders and preflight probes, not inputs.
/tools/everplate-assets/tmp/

# --- Editor / IDE local state --------------------------------------------
*.xcuserstate
